Pikmelo Server online platform compatibility

The platform request formats, signing constants, metadata mapping and lyric
formats in search.go and assets.go are adapted to Go from LX Music Desktop.

Upstream project: LX Music Desktop
Authors: lyswhut and contributors
Source: https://github.com/lyswhut/lx-music-desktop
Reference commit: 323e4bac505da428adae8db6b58039fb2b36b86d
Reference paths: src/renderer/utils/musicSdk and src/renderer/store/search/music
License: Apache License 2.0, reproduced in LICENSE-LX-Music.txt.

Pikmelo modifications include server-side public-network enforcement, bounded
HTTP requests, Go platform normalization, partial search results, constrained
JavaScript-worker integration, user quotas and transactional library import.
